# If you prefer the allow list template instead of the deny list, see community template:
# https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/community/Golang/Go.AllowList.gitignore
#
# Binaries for programs and plugins
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib

# Test binary, built with `go test -c`
*.test

# Output of the go coverage tool, specifically when used with LiteIDE
*.out

# Compiled Object files, Static and Dynamic libs (Shared Objects)
*.o
*.a

# OS General
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store

# project
*.cert
*.key
*.log
bin/

# Develop tools
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp

# ZCode CLI - 忽略会话级临时产物（plans/state 等），保留项目级 skills
# （**/ 前缀使规则覆盖任意层级子目录，如 frontend/admin/.zcode/）
**/.zcode/*
!**/.zcode/skills/

# 浏览器 e2e 测试产物（截图、playwright 缓存）
chk-*.png
.playwright-mcp/

# GUI e2e 扫测截图证据（会话产物不入库）
gui-test-screenshots/

# 审计日志归档任务的落盘目录（AUDIT_ARCHIVE_DIR，默认 ./data/audit-archive，按进程 CWD 生成）
**/data/audit-archive/

# 依赖目录兜底（各端自己的 .gitignore 之外，防在错误目录跑包管理器把依赖带进仓）
node_modules/

# 本地调试残留（含登录响应/token）
login-resp.json
*-login-resp.json
